WEBVTT

00:00:52.754 --> 00:00:55.815
At last, the True Book of Spells
and the 100 fairy species...

00:00:55.924 --> 00:00:58.154
...have gone into Grande's hands.

00:00:58.259 --> 00:01:01.524
Witch Heaven is approaching
total destruction.

00:01:02.163 --> 00:01:05.758
Even in times like this, Arusu
and the others stay optimistic...

00:01:05.867 --> 00:01:09.235
...and agree to do whatever
they can in order to survive.

00:01:09.904 --> 00:01:13.363
But all of a sudden,
dark magic was activated.

00:01:13.942 --> 00:01:14.841
Why?

00:01:15.243 --> 00:01:18.474
Who was the traitor among the witches?

00:02:47.735 --> 00:02:51.103
Tweeny Witches

00:02:55.643 --> 00:03:00.103
Light Magic

00:03:04.686 --> 00:03:07.587
Get us out of here!

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:32.810
The reason why the Magical Realm
is going to be destroyed.

00:03:33.815 --> 00:03:36.375
Maybe this statue knows something.

00:03:36.885 --> 00:03:39.877
I'm going to have to
find out for myself.

00:03:43.524 --> 00:03:46.425
Good love, blossoming heart!

00:03:48.763 --> 00:03:52.791
If you believe with all your heart,
then anyone can use magic.

00:03:56.504 --> 00:03:59.337
Good love, blossoming heart!

00:04:14.188 --> 00:04:17.590
A witch who can activate dark magic...

00:04:18.092 --> 00:04:20.959
...has darkness in her heart.

00:04:21.262 --> 00:04:23.060
Go ask Grande!

00:04:27.402 --> 00:04:28.995
It can't be!

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.060
You have to be kidding!

00:04:33.574 --> 00:04:35.633
No!

00:04:36.945 --> 00:04:39.812
You were always by my side...

00:04:40.782 --> 00:04:42.079
Since when?

00:04:42.216 --> 00:04:44.082
Don't look at me!

00:04:46.187 --> 00:04:49.817
It appears the day of
judgment has finally arrived.

00:04:50.425 --> 00:04:54.191
The day when great hatred is awakened...

00:04:54.395 --> 00:04:55.590
Grand Master.

00:04:56.264 --> 00:04:59.097
Dark magic will create a storm...

00:04:59.334 --> 00:05:03.100
...and guide any
living thing to despair...

00:05:03.237 --> 00:05:05.535
...then destroy their spirit.

00:05:05.673 --> 00:05:07.607
It's a forbidden magic.

00:05:07.842 --> 00:05:10.504
We must go now...

00:05:11.512 --> 00:05:14.971
...in order to protect the
witches' pride and tradition.

00:05:15.083 --> 00:05:16.881
What did you just say?

00:05:17.185 --> 00:05:17.981
Please.

00:05:18.586 --> 00:05:21.954
| can't use light magic yet,
but now I understand.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.990
Only I can use it!

00:05:24.125 --> 00:05:26.116
Please tell me!

00:05:29.263 --> 00:05:31.630
Why? How could this be?

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.635
Sorry... I'm sorry.

00:05:35.403 --> 00:05:39.897
This is the dark magic that
will help create a new world.

00:05:40.241 --> 00:05:43.233
You understand? So what?

00:05:43.344 --> 00:05:47.440
What can you possibly do?
Dark magic has been activated!

00:05:47.648 --> 00:05:51.312
I don't care if I have just 1%
chance of using it. Please tell me!

00:05:51.419 --> 00:05:52.477
Wait!

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:57.991
Why? Why does it have to be Eva?

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:02.286
She sold her soul to the devil.

00:06:03.231 --> 00:06:06.929
In order to use dark magic,
you need darkness in your heart.

00:06:07.035 --> 00:06:10.733
She felt she lacked something.

00:06:10.972 --> 00:06:14.738
When I first saw her,
| knew she was the one.

00:06:15.543 --> 00:06:20.174
The light of hope can only
be seen when you look up...

00:06:20.648 --> 00:06:24.744
...from the very bottom of despair.

00:06:27.789 --> 00:06:31.225
When people get something that...

00:06:31.859 --> 00:06:34.487
...they lacked for a long time...

00:06:34.996 --> 00:06:39.058
...they will never be able to let it go.

00:06:40.501 --> 00:06:44.768
You want to use your magic again, right?

00:06:45.706 --> 00:06:48.266
You took advantage of her weak heart...

00:06:48.943 --> 00:06:50.035
Give her back!

00:06:50.445 --> 00:06:51.708
Help me.

00:06:52.313 --> 00:06:55.647
For the Warlock Realm
to live on, proceed!

00:06:55.783 --> 00:06:59.344
O dark magic, spread your blackness!

00:06:59.554 --> 00:07:02.353
Let me be the ruler of this place!

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:41.458
Stop this, Eva! Stop!

00:07:41.596 --> 00:07:42.825
Sheila!

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:45.590
Sheila, what's going on?

00:07:46.601 --> 00:07:49.093
| don't know what to do either!

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.798
No! Don't look at me, Arusu!

00:07:51.906 --> 00:07:53.465
Why, Eva?

00:07:53.674 --> 00:07:56.905
We're the Magical Girl Squad, you know!

00:07:57.044 --> 00:07:59.342
We make miracles happen with magic!

00:07:59.447 --> 00:08:02.678
You even said you're going
to work real hard with us!

00:08:02.783 --> 00:08:04.046
You said it!

00:08:04.152 --> 00:08:06.553
The truth is I can't do anything!

00:08:06.654 --> 00:08:08.122
That's not true!

00:08:08.556 --> 00:08:11.958
| can't make the impossible
possible like you, Arusu!

00:08:12.059 --> 00:08:15.552
I'm not strong like Sheila,
saying the Curse of Eternal Youth...

00:08:15.663 --> 00:08:17.654
...was a positive thing!

00:08:24.705 --> 00:08:26.104
We must fight.

00:08:26.741 --> 00:08:31.736
That is why I had
you look for the traitor.

00:08:32.313 --> 00:08:35.806
So that we could prepare
for a day like this.

00:08:36.417 --> 00:08:38.852
You want us to fight? But she's...

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:43.014
If you show your hatred, then
that will be used as their power.

00:08:43.124 --> 00:08:45.115
You must fight with innocence.

00:08:45.226 --> 00:08:46.853
But the enemy is Eva!

00:08:46.961 --> 00:08:49.089
No matter what the circumstances were...

00:08:49.197 --> 00:08:52.963
...she broke the law of the witches,
so she is considered a traitor!

00:08:53.067 --> 00:08:53.577
Stop!

00:08:53.601 --> 00:08:54.466
Stop!
Eva!

00:08:58.139 --> 00:08:58.935
Arusu!

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.132
Stop it!

00:09:00.308 --> 00:09:01.332
Atelia.

00:09:01.509 --> 00:09:05.139
Are you going to let the
traitor go unpunished?

00:09:05.646 --> 00:09:08.138
| am no longer their leader.

00:09:08.482 --> 00:09:09.244
What?

00:09:09.884 --> 00:09:13.650
| am just a woman who realized
what the most important thing is.

00:09:14.455 --> 00:09:15.718
Are you okay?

00:09:16.891 --> 00:09:20.657
Arusu was hurt,
but she doesn't feel a thing?

00:09:21.062 --> 00:09:22.496
She can't help it.

00:09:22.597 --> 00:09:25.066
Eva is not the Eva we knew before.

00:09:28.669 --> 00:09:31.661
Sheila, I'm going to the Human Realm.

00:09:31.806 --> 00:09:33.399
Human Realm? Wait.

00:09:33.507 --> 00:09:34.531
Granny!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:39.371
| want you to look after Eva
until I return!

00:09:39.547 --> 00:09:40.275
Arusu!

00:09:41.682 --> 00:09:45.641
If she keeps going like this, then
Eva is going to end up hating magic!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:50.123
Arusu?

00:09:50.458 --> 00:09:51.186
Yeah.

00:09:51.392 --> 00:09:54.362
She said she spoke to the
aubenas statue at the Sanctuary.

00:09:54.762 --> 00:09:57.993
| can't use light magic yet,
but now I understand.

00:09:58.099 --> 00:09:59.863
Only I can use it!

00:10:03.371 --> 00:10:05.999
We realized one day...

00:10:06.674 --> 00:10:10.941
...that there are those who can
use magic and those who cannot.

00:10:11.479 --> 00:10:15.677
Those who could not use magic
feared the ones who could.

00:10:15.883 --> 00:10:18.614
And they tried to eradicate them.

00:10:18.986 --> 00:10:22.217
It ended up creating
a feud between them...

00:10:22.356 --> 00:10:26.850
...and both sides overly used the
resources of magic and technology.

00:10:26.994 --> 00:10:31.261
The world lost its balance
and brought destruction.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.528
It's impossible!
You'll die before you get there!

00:10:35.836 --> 00:10:38.828
No one else can do it!
| have to do this!

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:43.236
I'm telling you because I know how
frightening the Interdimensional Sea is!

00:10:43.978 --> 00:10:45.742
Then tell me!

00:10:47.448 --> 00:10:49.917
Grande doesn't trust the witches.

00:10:50.418 --> 00:10:53.718
The same goes for the humans
who came to this realm.

00:10:53.821 --> 00:10:57.758
He imprisoned my dad since he feared
my dad would destroy this realm.

00:10:58.359 --> 00:11:02.592
Dark magic is the fruit of
hatred, doubt, and despair!

00:11:03.064 --> 00:11:05.999
You understand? So what?

00:11:06.167 --> 00:11:10.195
What can you possibly do?
Dark magic has been activated!

00:11:11.172 --> 00:11:15.200
I don't care if I have just 1%
chance of using it. Please tell me!

00:11:17.778 --> 00:11:20.145
Tell me how to get to the Human Realm!

00:11:20.681 --> 00:11:21.614
Arusu.

00:11:33.627 --> 00:11:36.619
Tweeny Witches

00:11:41.168 --> 00:11:45.628
Hope

00:11:52.012 --> 00:11:55.209
There's only one way to get
across the Interdimensional Sea.

00:11:55.349 --> 00:11:57.818
Don't fall from the Bridge of Time.

00:11:58.085 --> 00:12:01.385
If you fall in, you'll end up bait
for the interdimensional sirens.

00:12:01.522 --> 00:12:04.924
But I don't see any bridge.

00:12:08.229 --> 00:12:09.458
No way!

00:12:09.864 --> 00:12:11.832
| was just getting started!

00:12:14.735 --> 00:12:17.329
If the sirens get you,
then it's all over.

00:12:17.471 --> 00:12:20.736
You'll be wandering around
in time for eternity.

00:12:21.242 --> 00:12:23.836
You'll never get back
to the Magical Realm.

00:12:25.746 --> 00:12:28.340
I have to do this for
Eva and everyone else!

00:12:28.449 --> 00:12:31.009
| just have to get to the Human Realm!

00:12:31.118 --> 00:12:33.712
Bike, barbeque, take a ba...

00:12:36.357 --> 00:12:38.416
Supplement, analog...

00:12:45.966 --> 00:12:47.024
This is...

00:12:51.071 --> 00:12:52.038
Dad!

00:12:54.775 --> 00:12:56.504
Payarinko!

00:12:57.778 --> 00:12:59.872
My dad is coming home...

00:13:00.414 --> 00:13:03.543
My my papapapa payarinko!

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:12.157
You've got to tell the
whole class you're sorry.

00:13:12.326 --> 00:13:14.727
You're the ones who
should be apologizing!

00:13:14.862 --> 00:13:16.455
Hey, look out!

00:13:24.305 --> 00:13:26.740
What should we do?

00:13:26.941 --> 00:13:29.433
She's gone! She freakin' vanished!

00:13:29.543 --> 00:13:30.476
What?

00:13:31.445 --> 00:13:34.608
What the hell?
Using magic tricks and stuff.

00:13:34.715 --> 00:13:35.409
What?

00:13:35.516 --> 00:13:37.109
Such a weird outfit!

00:13:37.551 --> 00:13:39.451
You can see me?

00:13:40.187 --> 00:13:45.023
| see. I disappeared before, so I'm
replaced by the one from the future.

00:13:45.292 --> 00:13:46.987
What should I do?

00:13:48.562 --> 00:13:52.021
That is why I said
dark magic is forbidden.

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:56.266
Dark magic makes everything disappear...

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:59.032
...and creates a new place to rebuild.

00:13:59.306 --> 00:14:01.673
But real despair...

00:14:01.775 --> 00:14:07.578
...takes away the will of the people
to rebuild and even their hopes.

00:14:07.882 --> 00:14:12.410
Within that despair,
no one can have any hope.

00:14:12.887 --> 00:14:17.188
Grande, the head of the warlocks,
had made a grave mistake.

00:14:18.092 --> 00:14:20.584
You want us to sacrifice Eva?

00:14:26.934 --> 00:14:27.924
Yoko.

00:14:29.303 --> 00:14:34.173
The crow statue on Crow Island has been
left unattended and is falling apart...

00:14:34.275 --> 00:14:36.141
In order to save everyone...

00:14:36.243 --> 00:14:39.941
...I have to bring back
Eva's favorite chestnuts.

00:14:41.649 --> 00:14:43.344
I'm sorry, Yoko.

00:14:47.721 --> 00:14:48.984
Grand Master!

00:14:49.323 --> 00:14:52.020
What is light magic?

00:14:52.793 --> 00:14:55.421
You mean that legendary spell?

00:14:55.529 --> 00:14:58.499
It brings out the light from within...

00:15:02.036 --> 00:15:05.404
Magic is supposed to
make people happy, right?

00:15:06.206 --> 00:15:10.336
| don't want people to be hurt
by the magic that I truly love!

00:15:11.111 --> 00:15:14.706
Magic is supposed to create miracles.

00:15:15.883 --> 00:15:19.217
Light magic... It can't be...

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.064
Arusu?

00:15:46.113 --> 00:15:47.012
Sheila!

00:15:47.114 --> 00:15:49.583
I'm heading towards Eva! Help me out!

00:15:49.984 --> 00:15:50.678
Got it!

00:16:01.462 --> 00:16:02.520
Sheila!

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:07.324
Sheila!

00:16:09.236 --> 00:16:11.398
Eva! Snap out of it!

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:13.671
Go!

00:16:17.378 --> 00:16:18.504
Eva!

00:16:19.079 --> 00:16:21.207
Remember to believe with all your heart!

00:16:21.315 --> 00:16:23.249
Remember about us!

00:16:25.919 --> 00:16:28.411
Eva! This...

00:16:29.356 --> 00:16:31.415
Remember me with this!

00:16:36.964 --> 00:16:38.989
Is it true that where you come from...

00:16:39.066 --> 00:16:41.034
...you have nuts that
you can actually eat?

00:16:41.101 --> 00:16:43.331
Nuts that you can eat? You mean this?

00:16:43.437 --> 00:16:45.997
My favorite snack? Go ahead and try one!

00:16:46.106 --> 00:16:49.007
It's so sweet! It's melting in my mouth!

00:16:49.309 --> 00:16:51.277
Sweetheart...

00:16:54.815 --> 00:16:55.646
Eva!

00:16:55.883 --> 00:16:56.714
Eva!

00:16:57.518 --> 00:16:59.418
You remembered!

00:17:10.531 --> 00:17:11.396
Why?

00:17:11.532 --> 00:17:14.991
I did such a bad thing.
Why are you doing this for me?

00:17:15.135 --> 00:17:16.713
Because we're friends.

00:17:16.737 --> 00:17:17.761
Because we're friends.
Arusu.

00:17:18.405 --> 00:17:21.136
Light magic was right near us.

00:17:21.241 --> 00:17:21.867
What?

00:17:21.975 --> 00:17:26.503
Arusu was the magic of light that
could shed light into the darkness.

00:17:29.183 --> 00:17:31.242
The legendary magic of light.

00:17:31.385 --> 00:17:35.982
As long as we have that light,
we can start over from scratch.

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:44.591
No matter what the consequences were,
it still does not change the fact...

00:17:45.232 --> 00:17:50.432
...that you broke the law of the witches
and activated dark magic.

00:17:52.406 --> 00:17:54.807
What's going on?
Are you punishing them?

00:17:54.908 --> 00:17:56.103
Even Sheila?

00:17:56.343 --> 00:17:58.038
No need to worry.

00:17:58.178 --> 00:18:02.308
The grand master just removed the
Curse of Eternal Youth from them.

00:18:02.816 --> 00:18:06.616
| was afraid of humans
coming to this realm.

00:18:07.187 --> 00:18:10.953
That is because humans like you
ruin our tradition.

00:18:11.058 --> 00:18:12.321
But that's...

00:18:12.392 --> 00:18:17.023
But we have been trying to protect
our tradition for so long...

00:18:17.164 --> 00:18:22.102
...that we may have forgotten what is
truly important to us. Right, Atelia?

00:18:22.236 --> 00:18:23.635
Grand Master...

00:18:24.104 --> 00:18:27.130
Arusu. Cherish that name.

00:18:27.875 --> 00:18:30.776
Your name, in the language of humans...

00:18:30.944 --> 00:18:34.744
...who happen to be our good old friends,
actually means magic.

00:18:34.848 --> 00:18:36.646
Arusu... Magic...

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.519
Can you remain in this realm...

00:18:39.653 --> 00:18:44.147
...in order to create a better
Magical Realm than before?

00:18:44.792 --> 00:18:46.385
Thank you for the offer.

00:18:46.493 --> 00:18:49.053
But I'm heading back to the Human Realm.

00:18:49.229 --> 00:18:53.689
Because I now have the confidence
to succeed in the Human Realm.

00:18:55.569 --> 00:18:58.766
It's not like we can't see
each other ever again.

00:18:59.406 --> 00:19:01.568
We're the Magical Girl Squad, right?

00:19:02.176 --> 00:19:03.620
We'll say goodbye with a smile.

00:19:03.644 --> 00:19:04.736
We'll say goodbye with a smile.
Yeah.

00:19:05.179 --> 00:19:06.408
I should go now.

00:19:07.181 --> 00:19:08.148
Arusu!

00:19:08.282 --> 00:19:09.113
Arusu!

00:19:12.719 --> 00:19:15.916
There's one way to make everyone happy.

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:19.820
Each and every single person
has to make their...

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:22.893
...loved ones happy on their own.

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:26.930
If you can make your loved one happy...

00:19:27.034 --> 00:19:29.332
...then everyone can
be happy in the end.

00:19:29.503 --> 00:19:30.800
I'm sure of it.

00:19:33.874 --> 00:19:35.171
I'm home!

00:19:35.442 --> 00:19:36.910
You're late!

00:19:37.611 --> 00:19:41.013
What? These shoes...
Did you remarry, Yoko?

00:19:41.081 --> 00:19:44.381
What are you, crazy?
I told you this morning.

00:19:44.484 --> 00:19:47.818
He said he'd be back when
he's no longer busy with work.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:54.727
Dad!

00:19:57.531 --> 00:20:01.468
| have to say goodbye to magic
for now, but no need to worry.

00:20:01.735 --> 00:20:03.499
I'm sure everything will be fine.

00:20:03.604 --> 00:20:08.474
I found out that I can use magic
even in the Human Realm.

00:20:18.085 --> 00:20:26.049
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:26.226 --> 00:20:34.226
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:35.469 --> 00:20:43.469
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:44.678 --> 00:20:50.242
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:54.617
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:55.355 --> 00:20:59.588
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:59.693 --> 00:21:04.290
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:04.498 --> 00:21:09.664
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:12.831
Let's hope it does.

00:21:14.408 --> 00:21:18.902
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:19.012 --> 00:21:21.504
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:21.615 --> 00:21:29.615
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:30.824 --> 00:21:36.524
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:40.828
So we might as well just
make one of our own!
